flowchart LR
    Change[Contributor or agent change] --> Index[Exact staged snapshot]
    Index --> Policy[Versioned privacy admission policy]
    Policy --> Protect[Protected ignore and never-track gate]
    Policy --> Router[Conditional scanner router]
    Router --> Required[Required scanner wrappers]
    Required --> Receipt[Private content-bound receipts]
    Receipt --> Verify[Pre-push receipt verifier]
    Protect --> Verify
    Verify -->|valid and clean/reviewed| Push[Push]
    Verify -->|missing, stale, error, or finding| Block[Block]
    Push --> CI[Required CI independently evaluates policy]
    CI --> Merge[Merge]
